ind":"announcement","title":"Flowers to Honey releases November 9!","summary":"We’re happy to finally announce that Flowers to Honey will release on November 9!Over the past months, we’ve been working on expanding the game beyond the demo, adding more content, improving progression, polishing existing systems, and bringing everything closer to the experience we want for the full release.There are now just two months until release, and we’ll be spending that time polishing the game and preparing everything for launch.If you’ve played the demo, thank you for all the feedback","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T11:31:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4289700-1832065502820923","game_id":"steam-4289700","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The demo for Flowers to Honey is officially live!Over the past months, we’ve been expanding the original prototype with improved visuals, better balance, smoother progression, and brand-new systems.In the demo you can:Plant flowers and build your meadowEvolve your bees with permanent choicesUnlock research, helper bugs, and Queen tasksShape your hive while gameplay and upgrades stay on screen at all timesAs a 2-person team, your feedback helps shape the final game, so if you try the demo, we’d l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T11:13:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502820923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4289700-1830163047262251","game_id":"steam-4289700","kind":"announcement","title":"Flowers to Honey demo launches May 11","summary":"We’re happy to share that the Flowers to Honey demo will launch on May 11.Since the last update, we’ve been working on improving visuals, balance, and expanding content from the itch.io prototype.If you haven’t tried it yet, you can still play the prototype here: https://thinking-cat-games.itch.io/flowers-to-honeyThe upcoming demo will include more polished progression, new systems, and an overall smoother experience.If you enjoy cozy incremental games, we’d love for you to check it out when it ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-18T11:48:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047262251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4289700-1825727806719634","game_id":"steam-4289700","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Page Live - demo coming soon!","summary":"Flowers to Honey steam page is live!Our next step is demo, that is coming soon. We are currently working hard to improve visuals, balance and add in more content from our itch.io prototype that you can try out here: https://thinking-cat-games.itch.io/flowers-to-honeyIf you enjoy incremental games with a relaxing and cozy vibe, we would love for you to check it out when it launches and share your feedback.If you played itch.io prototype and already have thoughts on what we should improve in this ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-03T09:51:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806719634","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4289700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4289700":"2026-10-26T02:09:27Z"},"notices":[],"n